###  http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#PengendalianSelainItuPestisidaNabatiJuga_f7bea0f0
ptp:PengendalianSelainItuPestisidaNabatiJuga_f7bea0f0 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
